# ─── Vantix Admin Frontend — Environment Configuration ───────────────────────
# When hosting on Vercel, set these Environment Variables in your Vercel Project Settings:

# 1. Hosted Backend API URL (without trailing slash)
# Example: https://vantix-backend.onrender.com
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000

# 2. Hosted WebSocket URL for live SOC telemetry stream
# Example: wss://vantix-backend.onrender.com/ws/vantix
VITE_WS_URL=ws://localhost:5000/ws/vantix
